      "end_minus_years": 0,
      "end_plus_years": 0,
      "note": "Start is the 138 BCE departure; end is his death in 114 BCE (China Daily). Return is 125 BCE in one source and 126 BCE in another; birth is given as 164 or 195 BCE."
